  "body": "When you add an email address to an account, you get an email which invites you to click on a link whose path is `https://<server>/_matrix/client/unstable/add_threepid/email/submit_token?token=...&client_secret=...`.\r\n\r\nWe should not be using an `unstable` prefix for stable features. The correct path for this would be something under `https://<server>/_synapse/client/...`.  Of course we'll have to support both for a while to avoid breaking the links in any emails that have already been sent.\r\n\r\n(This was added in #6042, and probably should have been cleaned up as part of finalising https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2290)",
